---
// Starlight `ThemeProvider` override: only the pre-paint `data-theme` set, inline to avoid FOUC.
// Starlight's own also ships `updatePickers` and a `<template>` of three icons for its
// `<starlight-theme-select>`, which ThemeSelect.astro replaces: ~850 B gzip of dead weight on every
// page (htmlGz). Same storage key and fallback as Starlight's; `auto` or no entry follows the OS.
// Hand-minified, as every page carries it.
import { THEME_SCRIPT } from '../head-scripts.mjs';
---

<script is:inline set:html={THEME_SCRIPT} />
